  "question": {
    "text": "Let the solution curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;pass through the origin. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>This is of the form of linear differential equation</p><p>I.F.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>So the solution of the differential equation will be&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Since the curve passes through origin&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>32</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>"
  }
}